# Windsurf — VantaMP

Read `AGENTS.md` before editing. Human map: `docs/README.md`.

This folder is the VantaMP git repo. Do not edit the Framework outside it,
`current/`, or `reference/`. Do not commit unless asked.

- Signatures in `code/client/src/sdk/patterns.*`, never hardcoded addresses.
- Never null-check a resolved `gPatterns.*` entry.
- plugin-sdk / `CPed` / `CVehicle` only in `VANTAMP_CLIENT_SDK_FILES`.
- Append-only wire. Occupancy is a reliable RPC. F = jack, G = passenger.
- Do not write GTA outputs. Heading is +0x558, not the matrix.
- `OpenDoor` only on a real ratio change. Driver owns the swing.
- Build from `new/`: `builds\build.bat VantaMPClient 32` and
  `builds\build.bat VantaMPServer 64`.
